1 for the root, 3 for","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"third, etc). The text attribute specifies how the value of the degree should be displayed. The symbol","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"attribute indicates that a symbol should be used in specifying the degree. If the symbol attribute is present,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the value of the text attribute follows the symbol.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","kind":"identifier"}]}}}